{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaXVyWV2hMUQtKmTKxU4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I replaced the `sorry` in `take_append_drop`, and `lean Main.lean` now runs with no errors or warnings.\n\nThe proof uses induction on `n`, applied to every list `xs` (`generalizing xs`):\n- **`n = 0`:** `myTake` returns `[]` and `myDrop` returns `xs`, so `simp` closes it.\n- **`n + 1`, empty list:** both functions return `[]`, so `simp` closes it.\n- **`n + 1`, list `x :: xs`:** after unfolding, the goal becomes `x :: (myTake n xs ++ myDrop n xs) = x :: xs`. The induction hypothesis finishes it.\n\n```lean\ntheorem take_append_drop (n : Nat) (xs : List α) : myTake n xs ++ myDrop n xs = xs := by\n  induction n generalizing xs with\n  | zero => simp [myTake, myDrop]\n  | succ n ih =>\n    cases xs with\n    | nil => simp [myTake, myDrop]\n    | cons x xs => simp [myTake, myDrop, ih]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":473,"cache_read_input_tokens":7964,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":473},"output_tokens":370,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7df05605-4b25-4f22-8a71-909f37a054ae","uuid":"6e183045-22d2-4378-b2a4-7673cc0c5d2d","timestamp":"2026-10-31T15:09:30.292Z","request_id":"req_011CgaXVyHpwLNjs3etnZcoT"}
